Type: Package
Title: Modelling Zero Values in Compositional Data Using a Censored
        Model
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-08-03
Authors@R: person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr")
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
